es are processed in memory and sent to our AI service to estimate stair dimensions. They are ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"never saved to your camera roll"}],", never stored on our servers, and discarded immediately after measurement."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Location"}]," — approximate GPS coordinates, collected once per session to detect your local building code jurisdiction. We do not track your location over time or share it with third parties."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Account information"}]," — if you sign in, we store your email address or phone number and membership tier. OAuth providers (Google, Apple) share only a user ID and email."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Usage analytics"}]," — anonymous session events (screen views, scan count) to improve the product. No personally identifiable information is attached."]}]]}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"style":{"marginBottom":"2rem"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.1rem","fontWeight":700,"marginBottom":"0.6rem","color":"#0A1C2E"},"children":"3. How we use your data"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.92rem","color":"#1f2937"},"children":["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"To provide and improve the measurement and compliance features."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To detect your jurisdiction and apply the correct building code."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To manage your account and membership."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To send transactional emails (OTP codes, receipts). We do not send marketing email without consent."}]]}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"style":{"marginBottom":"2rem"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.1rem","fontWeight":700,"marginBottom":"0.6rem","color":"#0A1C2E"},"children":"4. AI processing"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.92rem","color":"#1f2937"},"children":["Camera frames are transmitted over HTTPS to th